# Notification Center: panel at the right under the bar (x≈1530..1912 Material, 1544..1912 Glass); read rows from the first shot
look glass
wait 2
ipc panels open notificationCenter IRICE-TEST
wait 1
shot calendar
note the month grid from the shot: wheel one notch over it = one month
note follow the numbered plan in shell_modules_notifications_CalendarWidget.qml.md (+, double-click, edit, drag, delete/Undo) with coordinates from this shot
note Week view: wheel steps weeks; close NC in Week view, reopen: Month view
ipc panels close
